#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow.rst:2
#: baaf6a56f4ce4c3899e4fbfea667e3b8
msgid "Cylinder Flow (Vortex Shedding)"
msgstr "圆柱绕流（涡脱落）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow.rst:4
#: 0d493b3525414e02a9c4571f570514d6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The transient counterpart to the steady cavity examples. The script "
"``examples/fluid/cylinder_flow/cylinder_flow.py`` runs the classic *flow "
"past a circular cylinder* benchmark — a long rectangular channel with a "
"small cylinder near the inlet. At :math:`\\mathrm{Re} = 100` the wake "
"becomes unstable, vortices shed alternately from the top and bottom of the "
"cylinder, and a **von Kármán vortex street** propagates downstream. The "
"geometry and parameters follow the DFG 2D benchmark (Schäfer & Turek, 1996)."
msgstr ""
"稳态空腔算例的瞬态对应版本。脚本 ``examples/fluid/cylinder_flow/cylinder_flow.py`` 运行经典的\\ "
"*圆柱绕流*\\ 基准算例——一个长矩形通道，在入口附近放置一个小圆柱。当 :math:`\\mathrm{Re} = 100` "
"时，尾流失稳，涡旋交替从圆柱上下表面脱落，\\ **卡门涡街**\\ 向下游传播。几何与参数遵循 DFG 二维基准（Schäfer & Turek, "
"1996）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow.rst:14
#: 43e70136c7e0430cb156f18678757398
msgid ""
"Discretization: **Taylor-Hood P2-P1** via "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler`, backward Euler in time with "
"Picard sub-iterations. Two things make this script the \"advanced\" mixed "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"离散化：通过 :class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler` 采用 **Taylor-Hood P2-P1** "
"元，时间方向用向后欧拉格式，配合 Picard 子迭代。以下两点使该脚本成为\"进阶\"混合元示例："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow.rst:19
#: 5ad6c0564f774df4a14b2b73d34decd5
msgid ""
"the gmsh/:class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` channel mesh is **linear** — the "
"quadratic velocity space is generated *topologically* on top of it (one DOF "
"per unique edge), no order-2 re-meshing;"
msgstr ""
"gmsh/:class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` 生成的通道网格是\\ **线性**\\ 的——二次速度空间在其上\\ *拓扑地*\\"
" 构造（每条唯一边对应一个自由度），无需二阶重新剖分；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow.rst:22
#: e4cc8bad35f94dc9905eb83a717c04fe
msgid ""
"the load vector and the vorticity post-processing both go through "
":meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.assemble_vector`, with the lagged "
"velocities riding on the P2 field's own DOFs via ``field_data``."
msgstr ""
"载荷向量与涡量后处理均通过 :meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.assemble_vector` "
"完成，滞后速度借助 ``field_data`` 搭载在 P2 场自身的自由度上。"

